## Story Description
Add two endpoints to backend/app/routers/recommendations.py. GET /config returns the current per-engagement recommendation thresholds as a flat dict (config.yaml defaults merged with any recommendation_config_json overrides stored on the engagement row). PATCH /config accepts a partial RecommendationConfigUpdate Pydantic body, merges the non-None fields into the existing stored JSON, and persists to engagements.recommendation_config_json. Both endpoints call verify_engagement_ownership and load_config() using the SPENDCUBE_CONFIG_PATH env var.

