- Edit file: backend/app/routers/recommendations.py — add PATCH /config endpoint decorated with @router.patch('/config'): verify_engagement_ownership; query existing recommendation_config_json; parse existing JSON or start with {}; update with body.model_dump(exclude_none=True); persist json.dumps(merged) back to engagements.recommendation_config_json; return merged dict
